  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\sum_{r=2}^{\\infty} \\frac{(r-1) r}{2 r !}=\\sum_{r=2}^{\\infty} \\frac{1}{2(r-2) !}$\r\n$=\\frac{1}{2}\\left[\\frac{1}{0 !}+\\frac{1}{1 !}+\\frac{1}{2 !}+\\quad \\infty\\right]=\\frac{1}{2} e$"
  }
}